{
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.24,
      "end": 1.96,
      "text": "I'm gonna invite you to close your eyes"
    },
    {
      "start": 1.96,
      "end": 5.04,
      "text": "and just bow your head"
    },
    {
      "start": 5.04,
      "end": 7.76,
      "text": "and just get in a comfortable spot"
    },
    {
      "start": 7.76,
      "end": 11.4,
      "text": "and just take a moment in the quiet."
    },
    {
      "start": 12.9,
      "end": 15.08,
      "text": "Just kind of shut everything else out."
    },
    {
      "start": 16.3,
      "end": 17.74,
      "text": "I'm gonna read through some scripture."
    },
    {
      "start": 18.32,
      "end": 20.3,
      "text": "I'm gonna guide us all through some thoughts"
    },
    {
      "start": 20.3,
      "end": 22.26,
      "text": "to let God just speak to us today."
    },
    {
      "start": 24.16,
      "end": 27.38,
      "text": "But right now, just focus on getting your mind quiet"
    },
    {
      "start": 27.38,
      "end": 28.72,
      "text": "and just breathe."
    },
    {
      "start": 30.64,
      "end": 31.9,
      "text": "Just take a few moments."
    },
    {
      "start": 32.72,
      "end": 34.18,
      "text": "Just imagine you're in a room."
    },
    {
      "start": 36.12,
      "end": 37.9,
      "text": "Imagine God is sitting with you."
    },
    {
      "start": 41.92,
      "end": 43.48,
      "text": "Think about what that feels like."
    },
    {
      "start": 44.54,
      "end": 45.42,
      "text": "Just take a few minutes."
    },
    {
      "start": 45.54,
      "end": 47.24,
      "text": "Just imagine sitting down with God."
    },
    {
      "start": 47.48,
      "end": 49.08,
      "text": "Don't say or pray anything."
    },
    {
      "start": 49.26,
      "end": 51.14,
      "text": "Just be in his presence."
    },
    {
      "start": 60.0,
      "end": 67.98,
      "text": "Now just imagine God brings out a box"
    },
    {
      "start": 67.98,
      "end": 69.94,
      "text": "and he hands it to you."
    },
    {
      "start": 71.22,
      "end": 73.84,
      "text": "Imagine that box contains all the thoughts"
    },
    {
      "start": 73.84,
      "end": 75.64,
      "text": "in your head right now that give you concern."
    },
    {
      "start": 77.32,
      "end": 78.88,
      "text": "The thoughts that cause you to worry."
    },
    {
      "start": 79.4,
      "end": 80.76,
      "text": "Thoughts that you're anxious about."
    },
    {
      "start": 84.18,
      "end": 85.62,
      "text": "Some of us have big boxes."
    },
    {
      "start": 85.84,
      "end": 86.88,
      "text": "Some of us have little ones."
    },
    {
      "start": 86.94,
      "end": 87.68,
      "text": "But don't open it yet."
    },
    {
      "start": 87.78,
      "end": 89.42,
      "text": "Just sit with that box."
    },
    {
      "start": 97.92,
      "end": 99.88,
      "text": "God, we know that you know everything."
    },
    {
      "start": 101.36,
      "end": 102.86,
      "text": "You know all our thoughts."
    },
    {
      "start": 105.1,
      "end": 107.54,
      "text": "In Psalm 139, David says,"
    },
    {
      "start": 107.98,
      "end": 110.04,
      "text": "Search me, O God, and know my heart."
    },
    {
      "start": 110.46,
      "end": 112.62,
      "text": "Test me and know my anxious thoughts."
    },
    {
      "start": 113.04,
      "end": 115.16,
      "text": "Point out anything in me that offends you"
    },
    {
      "start": 115.16,
      "end": 118.28,
      "text": "and lead me along the path of everlasting life."
    },
    {
      "start": 122.64,
      "end": 125.12,
      "text": "So Lord, let's start with just one small thing."
    },
    {
      "start": 125.98,
      "end": 128.68,
      "text": "Search me and know my anxious thoughts."
    },
    {
      "start": 131.44,
      "end": 133.42,
      "text": "Of all the thoughts that are in that box,"
    },
    {
      "start": 133.48,
      "end": 135.02,
      "text": "I just want you to take the lid off"
    },
    {
      "start": 135.02,
      "end": 137.0,
      "text": "and just take out one small thought."
    },
    {
      "start": 137.32,
      "end": 139.32,
      "text": "Something that you're struggling with right now."
    },
    {
      "start": 139.8,
      "end": 140.86,
      "text": "That you're anxious about."
    },
    {
      "start": 142.14,
      "end": 144.3,
      "text": "Take out one thought you've been wrestling with."
    },
    {
      "start": 144.32,
      "end": 144.94,
      "text": "A small one."
    },
    {
      "start": 145.46,
      "end": 147.62,
      "text": "Something that's manageable for the time that we have."
    },
    {
      "start": 151.08,
      "end": 152.82,
      "text": "But if you have that thought in your hand,"
    },
    {
      "start": 152.98,
      "end": 154.02,
      "text": "pray this prayer with me."
    },
    {
      "start": 154.52,
      "end": 155.54,
      "text": "Search me, O God."
    },
    {
      "start": 156.28,
      "end": 157.24,
      "text": "Know my heart."
    },
    {
      "start": 158.56,
      "end": 160.48,
      "text": "Test me and know my anxious thoughts."
    },
    {
      "start": 165.82,
      "end": 167.92,
      "text": "So now imagine you have this thought in your hand."
    },
    {
      "start": 168.1,
      "end": 169.12,
      "text": "Now look at God."
    },
    {
      "start": 171.88,
      "end": 173.16,
      "text": "Hand over that thought."
    },
    {
      "start": 173.34,
      "end": 175.64,
      "text": "Hand over that anxious thought."
    },
    {
      "start": 180.02,
      "end": 181.84,
      "text": "Take this from us right now."
    },
    {
      "start": 183.62,
      "end": 186.12,
      "text": "Help me to trust that you will show me"
    },
    {
      "start": 186.12,
      "end": 187.22,
      "text": "how to deal with this."
    },
    {
      "start": 189.1,
      "end": 190.32,
      "text": "Because I got too many things"
    },
    {
      "start": 190.32,
      "end": 191.36,
      "text": "I'm dealing with right now."
    },
    {
      "start": 192.98,
      "end": 193.7,
      "text": "Lead me."
    },
    {
      "start": 195.78,
      "end": 196.9,
      "text": "Guide me, I pray."
    },
    {
      "start": 201.82,
      "end": 203.08,
      "text": "And we know from God's word"
    },
    {
      "start": 203.08,
      "end": 204.24,
      "text": "that we have confidence"
    },
    {
      "start": 204.24,
      "end": 206.04,
      "text": "that we can give to God"
    },
    {
      "start": 206.04,
      "end": 207.54,
      "text": "but we can trust it to God"
    },
    {
      "start": 207.54,
      "end": 209.02,
      "text": "that he loves us."
    },
    {
      "start": 209.46,
      "end": 210.66,
      "text": "He wants the best for us"
    },
    {
      "start": 210.66,
      "end": 211.64,
      "text": "that in all things"
    },
    {
      "start": 211.64,
      "end": 213.18,
      "text": "God works for the good"
    },
    {
      "start": 213.18,
      "end": 214.68,
      "text": "of those who love him"
    },
    {
      "start": 214.68,
      "end": 216.3,
      "text": "who have been called"
    },
    {
      "start": 216.3,
      "end": 217.46,
      "text": "according to his purpose."
    },
    {
      "start": 222.36,
      "end": 223.7,
      "text": "Now sitting there with God"
    },
    {
      "start": 223.7,
      "end": 225.06,
      "text": "imagine he turns to you"
    },
    {
      "start": 225.06,
      "end": 226.94,
      "text": "and says these words"
    },
    {
      "start": 226.94,
      "end": 228.98,
      "text": "from Isaiah 41 and 43."
    },
    {
      "start": 229.54,
      "end": 231.9,
      "text": "But now this is what the Lord says."
    },
    {
      "start": 233.14,
      "end": 234.82,
      "text": "He who created you Jacob"
    },
    {
      "start": 234.82,
      "end": 237.18,
      "text": "he who formed you Israel"
    },
    {
      "start": 237.18,
      "end": 239.14,
      "text": "do not fear"
    },
    {
      "start": 239.14,
      "end": 240.6,
      "text": "for I have redeemed you."
    },
    {
      "start": 242.04,
      "end": 243.84,
      "text": "I have summoned you by name"
    },
    {
      "start": 243.84,
      "end": 244.9,
      "text": "you're mine."
    },
    {
      "start": 246.9,
      "end": 248.56,
      "text": "When you pass through the waters"
    },
    {
      "start": 248.56,
      "end": 250.3,
      "text": "I will be with you."
    },
    {
      "start": 250.52,
      "end": 251.76,
      "text": "And when you pass through the rivers"
    },
    {
      "start": 251.76,
      "end": 253.1,
      "text": "they won't sweep over you."
    },
    {
      "start": 253.64,
      "end": 255.24,
      "text": "When you walk through the fire"
    },
    {
      "start": 255.24,
      "end": 256.62,
      "text": "you will not be burned."
    },
    {
      "start": 256.8,
      "end": 258.82,
      "text": "The flames will not set you ablaze"
    },
    {
      "start": 258.82,
      "end": 260.82,
      "text": "for I am the Lord"
    },
    {
      "start": 260.82,
      "end": 262.24,
      "text": "your God"
    },
    {
      "start": 262.24,
      "end": 263.96,
      "text": "the Holy One of Israel"
    },
    {
      "start": 263.96,
      "end": 264.7,
      "text": "your Savior."
    },
    {
      "start": 265.3,
      "end": 266.36,
      "text": "Fear not"
    },
    {
      "start": 266.36,
      "end": 267.5,
      "text": "for I am with you."
    },
    {
      "start": 268.8,
      "end": 269.98,
      "text": "Be not dismayed"
    },
    {
      "start": 269.98,
      "end": 271.08,
      "text": "for I am your God."
    },
    {
      "start": 271.24,
      "end": 272.58,
      "text": "I will strengthen you."
    },
    {
      "start": 273.4,
      "end": 274.54,
      "text": "I will help you."
    },
    {
      "start": 275.74,
      "end": 276.88,
      "text": "And I will uphold you"
    },
    {
      "start": 276.88,
      "end": 278.2,
      "text": "with my righteous right hand."
    },
    {
      "start": 281.7,
      "end": 282.68,
      "text": "He's for you."
    },
    {
      "start": 283.46,
      "end": 285.16,
      "text": "He's always thinking of you."
    },
    {
      "start": 285.16,
      "end": 289.32,
      "text": "Amen."
    }
  ]
}
